<%- include('partials/header') %>
<h1>Upload (path traversal lab)</h1>
<p>VULNERABLE: filename from <code>X-File-Name</code> header is joined into a path (CWE-22) with a runtime containment guard.</p>
<p>SECURE: <code>POST /upload-secure</code> sanitizes to basename + allowlist chars.</p>
<% if (result) { %><p>Result: target=<code><%= result.target %></code> written=<code><%= result.written %></code></p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/upload">
  <textarea name="content" placeholder="file content"></textarea>
  <button type="submit">Upload</button>
</form>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
